#: include/global_form.php:779
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Gamitin ang --alt-autoscale (binabalewala ang mga ibinigay na limitasyon)"

#: include/global_form.php:783
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Gamitin ang --alt-autoscale-max (tumatanggap ng lower limit)"

#: include/global_form.php:787
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Gamitin ang --alt-autoscale-min (tumatanggap ng upper limit)"

#: include/global_form.php:791
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Gamitin ang --alt-autoscale (tumatanggap ng parehong limitasyon, default ng RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php:796
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Logaritmikong Pag-scale (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php:800
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Gamitin ang Logarithmic y-axis scaling"

#: include/global_form.php:803
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "SI Units para sa Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php:806
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Gamitin ang SI Units para sa Logarithmic Scaling sa halip na exponential notation.<br> Tandaan: Ang mga linear graph ay gumagamit ng SI notation bilang default."

#: include/global_form.php:809
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Mode ng Rigid Boundaries (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php:812
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Huwag palawakin ang lower at upper limit kung ang graph ay may value na nasa labas ng valid na saklaw."

#: include/global_form.php:815
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Mataas na Limitasyon (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php:819
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Ang pinakamataas na patayong value para sa graph."

#: include/global_form.php:823
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Mababang Limitasyon (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php:827
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Ang pinakamababang patayong value para sa graph."

#: include/global_form.php:831
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon sa Grid"

#: include/global_form.php:836
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Halaga ng Unit Grid (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php:840
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Itinatakda ang exponent value sa Y-axis para sa mga numero. Tandaan: Ang opsyon na ito ay deprecated at pinalitan ng opsyong --y-grid.  Sa opsyon na ito, lumalabas ang mga grid line ng Y-axis sa bawat grid step interval.  Inilalagay ang mga label sa bawat label factor na linya."

#: include/global_form.php:844
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Halaga ng Unit Exponent (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php:848
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Anong unit ang dapat gamitin ng Cacti sa Y-axis. Gamitin ang 3 upang ipakita ang lahat sa \"k\" o -6 upang ipakita ang lahat sa \"u\" (micro)."

#: include/global_form.php:852
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Haba ng Unit (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:857
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Ilang digit ang dapat ipalagay ng RRDtool para sa mga label ng y-axis? Maaaring kailanganin mong gamitin ang opsyon na ito upang magkaroon ng sapat na espasyo kapag nagsimula kang mag-ayos ng pag-label ng y-axis."

#: include/global_form.php:860
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Walang Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php:863
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Upang maiwasan ang anti-aliasing blurring effects, isinasaayos ng RRDtool ang mga punto sa device resolution pixels, na nagreresulta sa mas malinaw na itsura. Kung hindi ito ayon sa gusto mo, maaari mong gamitin ang switch na ito upang i-off ang gawing ito.<br><strong>Tandaan: </strong>Naka-off bilang default ang Gridfitting para sa PDF, EPS, SVG output."

#: include/global_form.php:866
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Alternatibong Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php:869
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Tinitiyak ng algorithm na palagi kang may grid, na sapat ngunit hindi sobra ang bilang ng mga grid line, at na metric ang grid. Titiyakin din ng parameter na ito na makakakuha ka ng sapat na decimals na ipinapakita kahit na ang graph mo ay mula 69.998 hanggang 70.001.<br><strong>Tandaan: </strong>Maaaring makagambala ang parameter na ito sa mga opsyong --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php:872
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon sa Axis"

#: include/global_form.php:877
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Kanang Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:882
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Gagawa ng pangalawang axis sa kanan ng graph. Nakaugnay ito sa kaliwang axis sa pamamagitan ng mga parameter na scale at shift."

#: include/global_form.php:885
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Label ng Kanang Axis (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:890
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Ang label para sa kanang axis."

#: include/global_form.php:893
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Format ng Kanang Axis (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:898
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Bilang default, awtomatikong tinutukoy ang format ng mga label ng axis.  Kung nais mong gawin ito mismo, gamitin ang opsyon na ito kasama ang parehong mga argumentong %lf na kilala mo mula sa mga command na PRINT at GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php:901
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Formatter ng Kanang Axis (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:906
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Kapag itinatakda ang label ng kanang axis, maglapat ng rule sa format ng data.  Kasama sa mga sinusuportahang format ang \"numeric\" kung saan ituturing na numeric ang data, \"timestamp\" kung saan binibigyang-kahulugan ang mga halaga bilang UNIX timestamp (bilang ng segundo mula Enero 1970) at ipinapahayag gamit ang strftime format (default ay \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Tingnan din ang --units-length at --right-axis-format.  Panghuli, ang \"duration\" kung saan binibigyang-kahulugan ang mga halaga bilang tagal sa millisecond.  Sumusunod ang pag-format sa mga patakaran ng valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php:909
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Formatter ng Kaliwang Axis (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:914
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Kapag itinatakda ang label ng kaliwang axis, maglapat ng rule sa format ng data.  Kasama sa mga sinusuportahang format ang \"numeric\" kung saan ituturing na numeric ang data, \"timestamp\" kung saan binibigyang-kahulugan ang mga halaga bilang UNIX timestamp (bilang ng segundo mula Enero 1970) at ipinapahayag gamit ang strftime format (default ay \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Tingnan din ang --units-length.  Panghuli, ang \"duration\" kung saan binibigyang-kahulugan ang mga halaga bilang tagal sa millisecond.  Sumusunod ang pag-format sa mga patakaran ng valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php:917
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon sa Legend"

#: include/global_form.php:922
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Awtomatikong Padding"

#: include/global_form.php:926
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "I-pad ang text upang laging magkahanay ang legend at graph data. Tandaan: Maaari itong magdulot ng mas matagal na pag-render ng mga graph dahil sa mas malaking overhead. Maaari ring hindi tumpak ang Auto Padding sa lahat ng uri ng graph; kadalasang nakakatulong ang pare-parehong pag-label."

#: include/global_form.php:929
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Mga Dynamic na Label (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php:932
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Gumuhit ng mga line marker bilang linya."

#: include/global_form.php:935
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Pilitin ang Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php:938
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Pilitin ang paggawa ng mga legend na HRULE at VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php:941
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Lapad ng Tab (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:946
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Bilang default, 40 pixels ang tab-width; gamitin ang opsyon na ito upang baguhin ito."

#: include/global_form.php:949
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Posisyon ng Legend (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:953
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Ilagay ang legend sa ibinigay na gilid ng graph."

#: include/global_form.php:956
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Direksyon ng Legend (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php:960
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Ilagay ang mga item ng legend sa ibinigay na patayong pagkakasunod-sunod."

#: include/global_form.php:967 lib/api_aggregate.php:1902 lib/html.php:1534
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Uri ng Graph Item"

#: include/global_form.php:971
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Kung paano biswal na kinakatawan sa graph ang data para sa item na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:986
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Ang data source na gagamitin para sa graph item na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:993
msgid "The color to use for the legend."
msgstr "Ang kulay na gagamitin para sa legend."

#: include/global_form.php:996
msgid "Opacity/Alpha Channel"
msgstr "Opacity/Alpha na Channel"

#: include/global_form.php:1000
msgid "The opacity/alpha channel of the color."
msgstr "Ang opacity/alpha channel ng kulay."

#: include/global_form.php:1003 lib/rrd.php:4775
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Function ng Konsolidasyon"

#: include/global_form.php:1007
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Kung paano kinakatawan sa graph ang data para sa item na ito sa estadistika."

#: include/global_form.php:1010
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "Function ng CDEF"

#: include/global_form.php:1015
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "Isang CDEF (math) function na ia-apply sa item na ito sa graph o legend."

#: include/global_form.php:1018
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "Function ng VDEF"

#: include/global_form.php:1023
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "Isang VDEF (math) function na ia-apply sa item na ito sa legend ng graph."

#: include/global_form.php:1026
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Ilipat ang Data"

#: include/global_form.php:1029
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "I-offset ang iyong data sa time axis (x-axis) ayon sa halagang tinukoy sa field na 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php:1037
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Ang value ng graph item.<br/> [TICK]: Ang fraction para sa tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: Ang time offset sa mga segundo."

#: include/global_form.php:1040
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "Uri ng GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php:1044
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Kung ang graph item na ito ay isang GPRINT, maaari kang pumili rito ng ibang format. Maaari kang mag-define ng karagdagang mga uri sa \"GPRINT Presets\"."

#: include/global_form.php:1047
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Pag-align ng Teksto (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php:1052
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Ang lahat ng kasunod na linya ng legend ay iaayon ayon sa ibinigay dito.  Maaari mong gamitin ang command na ito nang maraming beses sa iisang graph.  Hindi gumagawa ng tabular layout ang command na ito.<br/><strong>Tandaan: </strong>Maaaring gusto mong maglagay ng &lt;HR&gt; sa naunang graph item.<br/> <strong>Tandaan: </strong>Ang &lt;HR&gt; sa linya ng legend na ito ay magpapawalang-bisa sa setting na ito!"

#: include/global_form.php:1055
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Format ng Teksto"

#: include/global_form.php:1060
msgid "Text that will be displayed on the legend for this graph item."
msgstr "Text na ipapakita sa legend para sa graph item na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1063
msgid "Insert Hard Return"
msgstr "Maglagay ng Hard Return"

#: include/global_form.php:1066
msgid "Forces the legend to the next line after this item."
msgstr "Pinipilit ang legend na lumipat sa susunod na linya pagkatapos ng item na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1069
msgid "Line Width"
msgstr "Lapad ng Linya"

#: include/global_form.php:1074
msgid "LINE1, LINE2 and LINE3 use fixed widths. For LINE:STACK, enter a width in pixels; integers or decimal values are supported."
msgstr "Gumagamit ng nakapirming lapad ang LINE1, LINE2 at LINE3. Para sa LINE:STACK, maglagay ng lapad sa pixel; sinusuportahan ang mga integer o decimal na halaga."

#: include/global_form.php:1077
msgid "Dashes (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"
msgstr "Mga Guhit (dashes[=on_s[,off_s[,on_s,off_s]...]])"

#: include/global_form.php:1082
msgid "The dashes modifier enables dashed line style."
msgstr "Ine-enable ng dashes modifier ang dashed line style."

#: include/global_form.php:1085
msgid "Dash Offset (dash-offset=offset)"
msgstr "Offset ng Guhit (dash-offset=offset)"

#: include/global_form.php:1090 include/global_form.php:1098
msgid "The dash-offset parameter specifies an offset into the pattern at which the stroke begins."
msgstr "Tinutukoy ng parameter na dash-offset ang offset sa pattern kung saan nagsisimula ang stroke."

#: include/global_form.php:1107
msgid "The name given to this graph template."
msgstr "Ang pangalang ibinigay sa graph template na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1114
msgid "Multiple Instances"
msgstr "Maramihang Instance"

#: include/global_form.php:1115
msgid "Check this checkbox if there can be more than one Graph of this type per Device."
msgstr "I-check ang checkbox na ito kung maaaring may higit sa isang Graph ng ganitong uri bawat Device."

#: include/global_form.php:1122
msgid "Test Data Sources"
msgstr "Subukan ang mga Data Source"

#: include/global_form.php:1123
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "I-check ang checkbox na ito kung nais mong subukan ang mga Data Source bago likhain ang mga ito.  Kapag naka-enable ang Test Data Sources, kung ang Data Source ay hindi nagbalik ng valid na data, hindi malilikha ang Graph.  Mahalaga ang setting na ito kung nais mong magkaroon ng mas generic na Device Template na maaaring magsama ng mas maraming Graph Template na maaaring piling i-apply depende sa mga katangian ng mismong Device.  Tandaan: Kung mayroon kang matagal na tumatakbong script bilang Data Source, tataas ang oras ng paglikha ng mga Graph."

#: include/global_form.php:1147
msgid "Enter a name for this graph item input, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Maglagay ng pangalan para sa input ng graph item na ito; tiyaking ito ay isang pangalang makikilala mo."

#: include/global_form.php:1155
msgid "Enter a description for this graph item input to describe what this input is used for."
msgstr "Maglagay ng paglalarawan para sa input ng graph item na ito upang ilarawan kung para saan ginagamit ang input na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1162
msgid "Field Type"
msgstr "Uri ng Field"

#: include/global_form.php:1163
msgid "How data is to be represented on the graph."
msgstr "Kung paano kakatawanin ang data sa graph."

#: include/global_form.php:1186
msgid "General Device Options"
msgstr "Pangkalahatang Opsyon ng Device"

#: include/global_form.php:1191
msgid "Give this host a meaningful description."
msgstr "Bigyan ang host na ito ng makabuluhang paglalarawan."

#: include/global_form.php:1198 include/global_form.php:1769
msgid "Fully qualified hostname or IP address for this device."
msgstr "Fully qualified hostname o IP address para sa device na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1206
msgid "The physical location of the Device.  This free form text can be a room, rack location, etc."
msgstr "Ang pisikal na lokasyon ng Device.  Ang free form na text na ito ay maaaring kuwarto, lokasyon ng rack, atbp."

#: include/global_form.php:1215
msgid "Poller Association"
msgstr "Kaugnayan sa Poller"

#: include/global_form.php:1223
msgid "Device Site Association"
msgstr "Kaugnayan ng Device sa Site"

#: include/global_form.php:1224
msgid "What Site is this Device associated with."
msgstr "Anong Site ang nauugnay sa Device na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1233
msgid "Choose the Device Template to use to define the default Graph Templates and Data Queries associated with this Device."
msgstr "Piliin ang Device Template na gagamitin upang tukuyin ang mga default na Graph Template at Data Query na nauugnay sa Device na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1241
msgid "Number of Collection Threads"
msgstr "Bilang ng mga Collection Thread"

#: include/global_form.php:1242
msgid "The number of concurrent threads to use for polling this device.  This applies to the Spine poller only."
msgstr "Ang bilang ng mga sabayang thread na gagamitin sa pag-poll ng device na ito.  Nalalapat lamang ito sa Spine poller."

#: include/global_form.php:1249
msgid "Disable Device"
msgstr "I-disable ang Device"

#: include/global_form.php:1250
msgid "Check this box to disable all checks for this host."
msgstr "I-check ang kahon na ito upang i-disable ang lahat ng pagsusuri para sa host na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1263
msgid "Availability/Reachability Options"
msgstr "Mga Opsyon sa Availability/Reachability"

#: include/global_form.php:1267 include/global_settings.php:811
msgid "Downed Device Detection"
msgstr "Pagtukoy sa Device na Bumagsak"

#: include/global_form.php:1268
msgid "The method Cacti will use to determine if a host is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Ang paraang gagamitin ng Cacti upang matukoy kung available ang isang host para sa polling.  <br><i>TANDAAN: Inirerekomendang piliin palagi ang SNMP bilang pinakamababa.</i>"

#: include/global_form.php:1277
msgid "The type of ping packet to sent.  <br><i>NOTE: ICMP on Linux/UNIX requires root privileges.</i>  <br><i>NOTE: TCP Ping Closed - Even if the tcp ping is not successful, the device can be considered UP.</i>"
msgstr "Ang uri ng ping packet na ipapadala.  <br><i>TANDAAN: Nangangailangan ng root privileges ang ICMP sa Linux/UNIX.</i>  <br><i>TANDAAN: TCP Ping Closed - Kahit hindi matagumpay ang tcp ping, maaaring ituring na UP ang device.</i>"

#: include/global_form.php:1314 include/global_form.php:1806
msgid "Additional Options"
msgstr "Karagdagang Opsyon"

#: include/global_form.php:1318 include/global_form.php:1811 pollers.php:92
#: sites.php:157
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Mga Tala"

#: include/global_form.php:1319 include/global_form.php:1812
msgid "Enter notes to this host."
msgstr "Maglagay ng mga tala para sa host na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1326
msgid "External ID"
msgstr "Panlabas na ID"

#: include/global_form.php:1327
msgid "External ID for linking Cacti data to external monitoring systems."
msgstr "Panlabas na ID para sa pag-uugnay ng data ng Cacti sa mga panlabas na monitoring system."

#: include/global_form.php:1349
msgid "A useful name for this host template."
msgstr "Isang kapaki-pakinabang na pangalan para sa host template na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1357
msgid "A suitable Class for the Device Template."
msgstr "Isang angkop na Class para sa Device Template."

#: include/global_form.php:1377
msgid "A name for this data query."
msgstr "Isang pangalan para sa data query na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1385
msgid "A description for this data query."
msgstr "Isang paglalarawan para sa data query na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1392
msgid "XML Path"
msgstr "Path ng XML"

#: include/global_form.php:1393
msgid "The full path to the XML file containing definitions for this data query."
msgstr "Ang buong path sa XML file na naglalaman ng mga kahulugan para sa data query na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1402
msgid "Choose the input method for this Data Query.  This input method defines how data is collected for each Device associated with the Data Query."
msgstr "Piliin ang input method para sa Data Query na ito.  Tinutukoy ng input method na ito kung paano kinokolekta ang data para sa bawat Device na nauugnay sa Data Query."

#: include/global_form.php:1421
msgid "Choose the Graph Template to use for this Data Query Graph Template item."
msgstr "Piliin ang Graph Template na gagamitin para sa item na Data Query Graph Template na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1450
msgid "A name for this associated graph."
msgstr "Isang pangalan para sa nauugnay na graph na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1478
msgid "A useful name for this graph tree."
msgstr "Isang kapaki-pakinabang na pangalan para sa graph tree na ito."

#: include/global_form.php:1485 include/global_form.php:2330
#: lib/api_automation.php:1612 tree.php:2040
msgid "Sorting Type"
msgstr "Uri ng Pag-uuri"

