msgstr "I-enable ang Structured Paths"

#: include/global_settings.php:2375
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Gumamit ng hiwalay na subfolder para sa mga RRD file ng bawat host.  Ang pagpapangalan ng mga RRDfile ay isa sa mga sumusunod:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Maaari mong gawin ang pagbabagong ito pagkatapos ng install sa pamamagitan ng pagpapatakbo ng CLI script na <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> pagkatapos mong gawin ang pagbabago.  TANDAAN: Kung babaguhin mo ang halaga ng Max Directories upang bawasan ang bilang ng mga directory, o kung babaguhin mo ang Directory Pattern, hindi aalisin ang mga walang lamang directory pagkatapos mong patakbuhing muli ang script na <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

#: include/global_settings.php:2379
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Pattern ng Direktoryo"

#: include/global_settings.php:2380
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Aling Directory Pattern ang nais mong gamitin para sa Structured RRD Path.  Ang 'Device ID' ang default.  Dapat gamitin ang setting na 'Device ID/Data Query ID' kapag may mga Device kang may libu-libong Graph.  Pagkatapos baguhin ang Directory Pattern, dapat mong patakbuhing muli ang Structured Path CLI script upang baguhin ang mga path ng RRDfile sa bagong Pattern."

