#: lib/installer.php:2078
msgid "The following PHP extensions are recommended, and should be installed before continuing your Cacti install.  NOTE: If you are planning on supporting SNMPv3 with IPv6, you should not install the php-snmp module at this time."
msgstr "Inirerekomenda ang mga sumusunod na PHP extension, at dapat na naka-install bago magpatuloy sa iyong Cacti install.  TANDAAN: Kung plano mong suportahan ang SNMPv3 na may IPv6, hindi mo dapat i-install ang php-snmp module sa ngayon."

